{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FBFBFE\\,#F5F5FC)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#181A1F\\,#1D1F28)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{hd.y}+({hd.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#5B5BD6|#A5A3FF",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。本包的源色 = 进度格用的那支靛 —— 它已经是这个包在盘上的样子,不另起一个。"
      },
      {
        "id": "hd",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "220pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "_note": "卡名说这张卡回答什么,不写包名(card-design-system §1.1):零参数卡 → 功能名。老名字「时间进度」= 包名,一块盘上三张 moment 卡挂同一个名字就分不出谁是谁。"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${today}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "时效锚(§3):右上角 / 9pt / 次级 / 右对齐。零网络包,粒度只到天 → MM-DD,不挂 HH:mm(这张卡上没有任何按小时变的量,挂了是个假精度)。"
      },
      {
